+# Cache eviction policy
+
+The project's recorded decision is to use LFU (least frequently used) eviction for its cache. LFU keeps frequently accessed items in the cache, which the team judged a good fit for this project's workload. No other eviction settings, such as capacity or TTL values, are recorded.
